              "value": "@egingin.comfyluxem |A vertical video shot in a cozy living room. An energetic person models a large, plush grey wearable blanket with a thick white sherpa lining and a hood. The video opens with them dramatically unfurling the blanket like wings, smiling broadly at the camera.The scene cuts to the person sitting and enthusiastically presenting a white, wired digital controller. They point to its screen and buttons, demonstrating the 10 adjustable heat settings and the 1-12 hour auto-off timer.The person then stands up again, lifting their foot to show off the practical wearable foot holes at the bottom of the blanket, allowing for mobility.A brief, low-angle pan shot reveals a pile of identical blankets on the floor in various new colors, including purple, tan, and pink. The video concludes with the person, back in the grey blanket, smiling and pointing energetically at the camera, conveying a strong sense of warmth and comfort. The overall tone is an upbeat product review."
